 job, you'll have to move to Boston, right?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah. What do you think I should do?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You may get it. It's better to be in Boston so you can start right away.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't know, V. If he moves too early, it'll be bad luck.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You believe that, Sally? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She's really superstitious. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If I move too early, I'm going to have to pay rent  at a new apartment.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's true. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not sure what to do.", "time": "14000"}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, if you move to Boston, I'll be the first person to visit! I love it here!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Why don't you apply for work there, V? Are you going back to San Francisco?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If I go back to San Fran, I'll have to see Marco again! I'm not sure I'm ready for that.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, you have time to think about it. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish I had time!! I can't make up my mind \u2026", "time": "30000"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}